      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>THORD — level 3 PC pregen, Dhul Maldur dwarf dissident, \"the turncoat\". Knows the mine in his bones; brings the roof down.</p><p><strong>Manual:</strong> Stonecunning — tunnel layout, hidden seams/levers, never lost underground (Perception/Survival proficient). Dwarven Resilience — advantage on saves vs. poison (poison resistance is on the sheet).</p>"
